name: widened-law
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a rule already enforced on one surface was found to govern
  surfaces the check never saw — the law widened without changing. Fires
  when the diff extends an existing invariant to a new carrier (a new AST
  node kind, an opaque text form, an exempted callee class) rather than
  stating a new rule.
